file tools/fixtures/d/dated_path_exclusions.sh dp_worktree_dirs derives every in-root worktree from git worktree list --porcelain and dp_find_prune anchors each as a find -path prune
file tools/fixtures/d/dated_path_scan.sh filters the collected pairs by worktree prefix, since grep matches a directory by name and a worktree is known by its path; LOST_CEILING 168 -> 165
file tools/fixtures/d/dated_path_control.sh a real git worktree in the pen, proven three ways: the walk sees it, the census declines it, an ordinary copy is still counted
